        { "n": 1, "at": "w1a", "f": 0.5, "text": "AWS Systems Manager sends the domain join command to the Windows EC2 instances in both Availability Zones. The private subnets have no internet route, so it reaches them through the Systems Manager interface endpoints in each subnet." },
